{"unit_id":"jiangliuhong__dsh-gpt-oauth#card-zh","repo":"jiangliuhong/dsh-gpt-oauth","commit":"abd0cf7cde21a0a71f902aeb32a9c4cef454e817","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-login-chatgpt 是面向 DSH web 客户端的模型接入插件，通过注册模型适配器和独立的 ChatGPT Login 设置页，把 ChatGPT OAuth 认证接入对话模型目录。用户可发起设备码登录、查看授权状态、取消或断开连接，并选择 openai-codex-gptoauth 路由中的 GPT 模型；登录凭据由 DSH credentials 服务保存。适合希望用 ChatGPT 账户在 DSH 中调用 GPT 模型的用户，需要可用的 ChatGPT 账户。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-56","client.js:35-83","login-manager.js:15-100"]}
{"unit_id":"jiangliuhong__dsh-gpt-oauth#card-en","repo":"jiangliuhong/dsh-gpt-oauth","commit":"abd0cf7cde21a0a71f902aeb32a9c4cef454e817","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-login-chatgpt adds ChatGPT OAuth login and GPT model access to DSH web. Its settings page starts device-code login, shows status, and supports canceling or disconnecting. The plugin registers the openai-codex-gptoauth route, and DSH credentials stores the login grant. Requires a ChatGPT account.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:13-56","client.js:35-83","login-manager.js:15-100"]}
