{"unit_id":"jiangliuhong__dsh-gpt-oauth#caveat-1","repo":"jiangliuhong/dsh-gpt-oauth","commit":"abd0cf7cde21a0a71f902aeb32a9c4cef454e817","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-login-chatgpt 使用前须知：插件会在本机 127.0.0.1:3091 开启登录接口；若端口被占用，插件启动会失败。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:18","index.js:59-62"]}
